      "value": "The limit should not be on the join side, it only renders people to use friend slots(which is unlimited), and it will stop information being spread since you can't really do announcements with the friend system, not to mention not everyone will use 'friend' system for that. It should be raise to more legit amount somehow(VRC+, one-time, free, event reward). Made no sense to 'VRSNS' to limit such stuff, it will only be a roadblock tbh",
